Z||000000||Xtreme Fiero's||12-03-2000||09:45 PM||||<BR>I just orderd new 16X7" light weight wheels for my Nissan D21 pickup truck ad was wondering what the best tire would be to wrap them with my budget is about $100-120 per tire I have got down to 4 tires to choose from.<P>YOKOHAMA AVS Intermeiate 245/45ZR-16 $100 each (My first choice)<P>BFGoodrich Comp T/A ZR 245/45ZR-16 $110 each<P>Bridgestone Potenza RE71 245/45ZR-16 $88 each, Potenza RE730 245/45ZR-16 $114 each <P>I figured that since all of them are spots car tires that somebody here on the forum might have a set on thier car nd may have some feedback, I do think the Yoko's will stick the best but will also wear out faster. ||||reg||5
